{"parentUuid":"7d9234f1-5e49-4274-bb88-907f3c273b7c","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ce914f6b-f81b-42fd-a40b-4c5550786125","agentId":"ac7100d52d01adab3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012Y4JBabLY7vxoNHyzfurNX","type":"tool_result","content":"18:(1) a minimal number of targeted abilities per block, because highly concentrated loads\n23:traditional, simultaneous-development model for high-level athletes (Table 1.4, PDF p. 20,\n57:traditional, complex (simultaneous multi-ability) model \"has visible benefits for the\n73:traditional planning (\"this innovative version has no advantage over traditional planning,\n85:traditional model he is arguing against; that is a different, narrower target than the 5th\n99:athletes; [[supertraining--verkhoshansky/framework--conjugate-sequence-system-of-training-means]] (Supertraining 5.3.3, successive concentrated blocks of means with a rising training effect; it cites this entry as agreeing that concentration is for high-level athletes, the dispute being which sports suit a single-target block; rated contested); [[supertraining--verkhoshansky/framework--conditio\n18:competition phase and one major peak,\" recommended \"FOR NOVICE AND JUNIOR ATHLETES. LONG","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"cde70fef-905a-487d-8e83-8fa51b77287a","timestamp":"2026-10-03T19:10:11.008Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"18:(1) a minimal number of targeted abilities per block, because highly concentrated loads\n23:traditional, simultaneous-development model for high-level athletes (Table 1.4, PDF p. 20,\n57:traditional, complex (simultaneous multi-ability) model \"has visible benefits for the\n73:traditional planning (\"this innovative version has no advantage over traditional planning,\n85:traditional model he is arguing against; that is a different, narrower target than the 5th\n99:athletes; [[supertraining--verkhoshansky/framework--conjugate-sequence-system-of-training-means]] (Supertraining 5.3.3, successive concentrated blocks of means with a rising training effect; it cites this entry as agreeing that concentration is for high-level athletes, the dispute being which sports suit a single-target block; rated contested); [[supertraining--verkhoshansky/framework--conditio\n18:competition phase and one major peak,\" recommended \"FOR NOVICE AND JUNIOR ATHLETES. LONG","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7d9234f1-5e49-4274-bb88-907f3c273b7c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"supertraining-ch4-3-4"}
